        "created_at": "2019-01-24T15:07:54.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>That would be pretty cool... I just got all of my Dice Throne Season 2 KS stuff and the custom character sleeves for each deck are gorgeous with a more character customized art piece for the sleeve. The deck backs are nice but they are less character oriented and more expansion oriented. I would support a custom sleeve project if it gave the decks a little bit extra.</p>",
